OK so the `agent.wait` returns the status of the run. Now let me think about the issue again.

Looking at the `runSubagentAnnounceFlow` function, the key part is:
```javascript
if (!reply && params.waitForCompletion !== false) {
  const waitMs = settleTimeoutMs;
  const wait = await callGateway({
    method: "agent.wait",
    params: {
      runId: params.childRunId,
      timeoutMs: waitMs,
